sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Channel as Channel<br/>(Telegram/Discord/...)
    participant Gateway as Gateway (Axum)
    participant RustBridge as RustBridge (HTTP)
    participant Coordinator as AgentCoordinator
    participant AgentSrv as AgentServer
    participant AgentLoop as Agent Loop (Rust)
    participant Provider as LLM Provider
    participant Tool as Tool Executor
    participant Memory as Memory Backend
    participant Hooks as Hooks (Hermes)
    participant BtwRouter as BtwRouter
    participant BtwServer as BtwServer
    participant SubSession as SubAgentSession

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over User, SubSession: Flow 1 - Inbound Message Processing
    User->>Channel: Send message
    Channel->>Gateway: ChannelMessage (via listen)
    Gateway->>RustBridge: HTTP POST /webhook
    RustBridge->>Coordinator: route_message/3
    Coordinator->>AgentSrv: GenServer.call(:handle_message)
    AgentSrv->>AgentLoop: chat_with_system()
    AgentLoop->>Provider: LLM inference request
    Provider-->>AgentLoop: ChatResponse (text + tool_calls)
    AgentLoop->>Hooks: on_response (Hermes extraction)
    AgentLoop-->>AgentSrv: Response text
    AgentSrv-->>Coordinator: {:ok, response}
    Coordinator-->>RustBridge: Response
    RustBridge-->>Gateway: HTTP 200
    Gateway->>Channel: send(SendMessage)
    Channel-->>User: Reply
    end

    rect rgb(237, 231, 246)
    Note over User, SubSession: Flow 2 - Tool Execution
    AgentLoop->>Tool: execute(tool_name, params)
    Tool->>Memory: store/recall (if memory tool)
    Memory-->>Tool: Result
    Tool-->>AgentLoop: ToolResult
    AgentLoop->>Provider: LLM with tool result
    Provider-->>AgentLoop: Next response
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
    Note over User, SubSession: Flow 3 - Agent Delegation
    AgentSrv->>Coordinator: delegate(task, capabilities)
    Coordinator->>SubSession: create(agent, task)
    Coordinator->>AgentSrv: spawn child agent
    AgentSrv->>AgentLoop: Execute delegated task
    AgentLoop-->>AgentSrv: Result
    AgentSrv-->>Coordinator: {:completed, result}
    Coordinator->>SubSession: update(:completed)
    Coordinator-->>AgentSrv: Delegation result
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
    Note over User, SubSession: Flow 4 - BTW Side-Channel
    User->>Channel: /btw check logs
    Channel->>Gateway: ChannelMessage
    Gateway->>RustBridge: HTTP POST
    RustBridge->>BtwRouter: route(/btw ...)
    BtwRouter->>BtwServer: handle in parallel
    BtwServer->>AgentLoop: Execute side task
    AgentLoop-->>BtwServer: Result
    BtwServer-->>BtwRouter: Response
    BtwRouter-->>Channel: Reply (non-blocking)
    end
